  "x-appname-rule": "a PR changing normative behavior updates the document section, this artifact, its tests, and generated docs IN THE SAME PR (Appendix I). JSON cannot carry comments; the Appendix I header block travels as these x-appname-* fields.",
  "x-spec-note": "Verbatim from §42.4. Prose constraints: the report persists into the imported document under meta[\"compatReport\"] (schema-valid per §7.3's open meta object); severity derives from action per §42.1 and is stored denormalized; error is present iff outcome=rejected; shared by every importer emitting compatibility data (PSD §8.5; ORA §8.4 and SVG §20.4 reuse it). The spec block carries no \"$schema\" key — added here (draft 2020-12 per §10.2/§40.9 gate 1)."
